{
  "$comment": "All-local F3 run on one machine (here maho-mac): it is the control host, the session host and the macOS desktop. Every host has sshDestination \"local\" (helpers run as direct children), MahoRD drives this machine's own maho-host on 127.0.0.1, and the run-owned relay listens on plain HTTP loopback. The iPhone and Windows lanes are not in this run and are recorded blocked (LANE_NOT_IN_RUN), so this run proves the macOS lane only and never passes F3 as a whole. For Windows use the same shape on maho-win: lanes [\"windows\"], hosts.windows and sessionHost with platform win32, Windows paths, and sessionHost.hostId distinct from the desktop's. binary/cli/relay must be inside the worktree.",
